---
/** One stop on a Timeline: the dot sits centred on the line, level with the first line of text. */
---

<li class="relative flex flex-col gap-lc-1">
  <span class="absolute -left-[38.5px] top-1.5 h-lc-3 w-lc-3 rounded-full bg-barro ring-4 ring-arena" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <slot />
</li>
